const ABOUT='<p>StockNest helps a campus supply room keep track of its technology equipment, such as laptops, peripherals, cables and storage, and tells staff when it is time to restock.</p><p>Every item has a unique SKU, a stock count, a minimum threshold and a target stock. When stock falls to the threshold or below, the system recommends ordering enough to reach the target. Stock can never go negative, and invalid requests are rejected without changing any record.</p><p>Built by Group 3 with HTML, CSS and JavaScript for the website and C++ for the backend logic.</p>';
